    "  ✗ the owner key in this entry is not a valid public key": "pools.detailInvalidKey",
    "  — this wallet does not hold the owner key, so this node could not withdraw the pool. Restore the MinimaCore wallet backup that created it first.": "pools.detailKeyNotEstablished",
    "  ⚠ this backup records NO signature count, so nothing here can detect a counter that has gone backwards. PandaPools will not withdraw automatically from a recipe like this.": "pools.detailNoCounter",
